Intuition
Since it involves overlapping, think about coordinates boundary

Approach
https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6040fd4f-937e-4f96-aca4-7acdb776c742
Check for the corners boundary conditions. That's all.

Solution:

class Solution {
    public boolean isRectangleOverlap(int[] rec1, int[] rec2) {
         return rec1[0] < rec2[2] &&
               rec2[0] < rec1[2] &&
               rec1[1] < rec2[3] &&
               rec2[1] < rec1[3];
    }
}


